{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d335478a59f53715e72d2c31594637cbcc6e6d6cf865fa0f0e75559c9ff9218",
      "text": "Sorry to call you in so suddenly.\nFrankly, this job is more than\nI can handle alone.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:34af0079c13a7139c7852f12c10ec94f3eaaf725c3d789e19853dababa35f667",
      "text": "No, your timing is perfect. Since\nthe Star Palace, that one has done\nnothing but drink and go soft.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "15": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:420b8f4f42796b4423053775917b35ea26b17a32b532c5f629fef08da7786027",
      "text": "Shut up. I've got my reasons... Just\nhurry up and tell us. It's a job\nfrom that military woman, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e0ab09997b1ef19a22ba16bc7725de00666529d8c754d635bddcb8e8cbb74024",
      "text": "Yes. With Colonel Selene involved,\nwe should expect it to be anything\nbut simple, no?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e90702bb5bf706d0bb3a762bb17a864ed2fb549419af14569cb8138b42143dff",
      "text": "The job is this: dive into Kowloon\nFloat and find the missing child of\na government official.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1235053c6252dace3735ac5aad65fbdef83abcddc1490eca54cb54ba3986a58",
      "text": "Kowloon Float... A den of iniquity\neven the Gaean government won't\ntouch. ...Was the child kidnapped?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71bef8053a8293246aaa2621a8c91ee669c6ea6b4feb8dbc50e79a3e78eb7fdd",
      "text": "Someone in the human trafficking\ntrade saw a missing child. We're\nto confirm whether that's true.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d7de8a9e221c79b4458832a116f82d67e503a98eece9575721ed56861ab7c626",
      "text": "A clumsy move could spark a feud\nbetween the Gaean government and\nKowloon, so she wants it quiet, but—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8861e5c632fec9d036bc18a9c0732103de98232d8eb0308a0bc3922089825f0a",
      "text": "The Colonel's words were, 'Move as\nyou please, and see for yourselves.'",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cda7bb6675907c0444de73615350b87b429928779938873e7b17ca15441530f8",
      "text": "...That does smell fishy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a9beea1e7ae936d413ce4192c865750e180bc3ab49610a2d18aa59f4617e3f25",
      "text": "...Then I'll do as I please.\nI just have to find the kid, right?\nFine, I'll do it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e19c0d4e9da692dd3b7ebcb453b46c99d8c556b0497b50b80f94ce9681c739de",
      "text": "Damn it...\nThere's not just one or two of them!\nSelgir...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b487b9aa9b9a42368f59ec89a698337058d3173f16d59c8049d60e2287a642cb",
      "text": "Yes, we can't leave them like this,\ncan we? Let's go...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c3bf2b6abbef46000b5dffacd5a3e7fda382ac97ff35c3eb521525f0049a28ab",
      "text": "Brace yourselves... you scum...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:76ee908caa8fc99c7489071cf7ae0a160f7c1478f105bb060cb8575f133026df",
      "text": "Hurry! The exit's right there—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd033b7fcf914d047d6258e341e7bd8046678de2e52e9160ae1ab77138546460",
      "text": "...Well, I'm surprised.\nQuite a big rat, for a rat.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bd1d72aeed32eb000720aa1e224bd86e0b2c7ab3f1bf42260fa255e82a6fe26e",
      "text": "Clean them up.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bbed7fc128a961bd4f702e81b8e99eb39950ba83c6896f01b7649cd02eb50b6c",
      "text": "Lanmei...!?\nLanmei of the Tsangli...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:49c7750b292d3fee018edf57683953c1ff5ea7db9bf8cedbfb19a384f7d3194a",
      "text": "............Who's she?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b4e4fbbaf50a3856897d1a91c9075ef712561b12eeb3abbb5b56278d2082af47",
      "text": "Just one of the snakes that lives in\nthis Kowloon. The vermin lying there\nwere my meal.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6475ee41c1d376f6f1aea27c286d2f5c38b7f9b80db2800cd04e102d52121de2",
      "text": "So I'd like to thank you. Won't you\njoin me for dinner, honored guests\nof Starview Village?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a1dc1e2479ad7730b061e8ec2f2dfa5a8a6493cad0526d7f5fac4f6c06177c02",
      "text": "The Tsangli are the mafia that grew\nstrongest in Kowloon lately. She\nbuilt that in a single generation.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eccb7a9e419389f8b94f3dd07b6a2a7c8f099e4525893e4baa3f7b30a5bee9ac",
      "text": "Such growth means fierce gang wars.\nMany groups were swallowed by the\nTsangli. ...This is no chance meeting.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:16c5d258995413a4b27117b0c7568e4a35096b1f0c8c9ab1fffee63447b5497d",
      "text": "Geez... What does that gorilla\nofficer expect us to do with a\nmafia boss?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:187ced0d9564d2da45f45d2a0ee35c5655fe841fdc7f35df67852820cfa91749",
      "text": "Forgive me for keeping you waiting.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3942481ea8220cae6b3cd03c67be92ce4099607d4adc02e11f59de95fe6e656",
      "text": "............Just you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c1f6767627279f1bd8e577857ed84c1d560dfd1b3be46dfc35b31373aebca858",
      "text": "My men are waiting outside.\nThey'd be useless against you,\nand unnecessary. Wouldn't they?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08346dd336bb24c656109cb3bda89074f161e6e7f2c82033f61d95ff067275db",
      "text": "Let's make a deal, Starview. I'm\nprepared to give you information on\nthe Star Augurs who oppose you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a0eb198923a63e56d6e10c6c0446020aad0845e6f65d22ebc88269bfbe2b9f17",
      "text": "If you like, I'll provide anything\nyou need here in Kowloon: standing,\ninformation, even ammunition.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7c4dddcd4d0a04131525c301007853f027d1bf868cbf200f06365c83720b5d5",
      "text": "...What do you want from us\nin return?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58ad09cadaa38e3337a3b02886c13f29d85317b081983910973229c077b3b92e",
      "text": "The wisdom and power of another\nworld. So that we, the Tsangli, can\nseize hegemony over this Kowloon.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:76ea3c1318022c59b7af93b07be8ae9b67566023876c47f6b9bcbab95677d245",
      "text": "And if I refuse?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0537f221187566dee6ae4b056cbbf68a01c0aadd92a2cbb9eb3bad6e2ed9a78d",
      "text": "Then I'll change my demands and\nmy offer. That's what negotiation\nis for, isn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f73fb32c24ea2ce38ef22a45f7f0379fb9918b1c52627f5297e82b6b50273471",
      "text": "At the very least, I\nbelieve we can agree to a\nmutual non-aggression pact.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:45a888377b20fd18fb4ae9115dfd9a012d52cac5d21e233f55d44bd3505e9983",
      "text": "We don't need information on the\nStar Augurs. Instead, let us look\ninto the whereabouts of that child.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:518069ef877e1fcf63cf0e0910666746f69de0967a027984e10bdbbd35d00546",
      "text": "Even just letting us re-check the\n'deal' records of the group we\ncrushed. You can't hide them today.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9cda808415fae81432c61fc1a5e06fcfaa8bc560b24761fc536b7e09128de269",
      "text": "Your face changed.\n...Hey. What were you planning\nto 'do' with those kids?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e4316707b61e479f3ab3a4c0c93acd7ead34b7a20e83170e8918129e15bd9cbe",
      "text": "That's enough, you two.\nI suspect what she's been doing\nis the opposite.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4d6cbbc7d460800e84d7957d6beea1b13a9f8d75f21d79599a5bd8a4016f155d",
      "text": "Huh...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:618d88f06d193155075d2eabb87951f7d40d05ad51f4dd8bdbcd0f08aa5d7331",
      "text": "On a separate matter for the Colonel,\nI investigated the Tsangli before. It\nwas a routine money-laundering trace—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:458d82e49a4a4c515a0fe57cc21c8259186b4308de630282d4bc9802988c2d4e",
      "text": "Strangely, some of the funds went to\n'child welfare', to an educational\ninstitution with no strings attached.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8291f58106f95d6b65a069d9c3a7a32294a95107b7a2ef7e81b702298becf7b4",
      "text": "A steel wolf has sharp eyes, I see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:356e276a794eff7c2fdd60e416141b3b5167c19ce31aaa54ce08d7b26a86760b",
      "text": "...Then today was about saving\nthat kid, too...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:87546de36fee9d6594d0651012075c98568449da7e89504488ce90e9b9093d94",
      "text": "But for a mafia boss, that's a\nweakness. Something a cold-blooded\nlady boss has no use for.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e872ad7372fa9a8d70bf80a28270c5e80626022aab218acb15aa3deba0c049dc",
      "text": ".........I'll give you the\ninformation. But I can't\nhand over that child... Lin.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "204": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de9cd51159351dc3f9b285f9ee4b5242b3df7ec3edc8097555e3320996f2f2a9",
      "text": "Why not? Even now, the child's\nparent is waiting for their return—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "207": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9381eb730df6f7034ce695eca8bd124cad82c90c0b47fb4fa9b1e08f051d9554",
      "text": "He's no parent...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:452a325054206cb3ed125c0e1b53fa7e4ad46e80f64183f9431c75afc474bfa1",
      "text": "On paper, I suppose he's her 'adoptive\nfather.' But Lin was born here in\nKowloon. ...So I took her back.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:77bd5eeaa31845e3cf71ba9bca3abe90c62e52fb2008be04ca4969457770ab9c",
      "text": "...I see.\nThen I'll say no more.\nLet's go, Nimbus, Selgir.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "218": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e1bbe1371f97416207a5fa53ca9b1a3b2ecb088a383cb55e570c38910de9c8c",
      "text": "You believe me rather easily.\nWhy is that?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f26f878e68d7c8c345d4f3d4930756d934326ad82732428890b8dc59b15b4549",
      "text": "Even when I aimed my gun, you\nsmiled. But in your eyes I glimpsed\na flame.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "224": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b60705c88e8065008447f4f7273919f27384821f7287f373a554b39bf34f186",
      "text": "The eyes of one who knows both anger\nand love. ...Now Selgir's story\nmakes sense to me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:820628ce74cca2d6c1046065d13256eb28712f55e83e2f225bb3687d39493124",
      "text": "Heh... hehehe.\nAhahahaha!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c3c169518749b3859b88703673ebcbe116c553ca6761c2d7ed9af69c70ad59f5",
      "text": "Won't you return to your seats,\nhonored guests of Starview Village?\nThe food hasn't even come yet.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "238": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d019714c28289c34662c8cdc371b890a4b93e439c21bf7b1c41b1949e68f1d27",
      "text": "And let's continue. To talk about\nways to expand what I can do\nto change Kowloon's future.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "243": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:665e338a7d5c16614ac35fef1f565d1659c94b97edaf715f3b8ef5fe66212976",
      "text": "Ha! You could've just said so\nfrom the start.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "246": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea70fa7b7adfe6ef363e7512837ae7b17af20a565852420a056da79c81911824",
      "text": "Then bring on the good food. I may\nnot look it, but I've got a refined\npalate. Don't expect to wow me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "250": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c39654e93b75c1b455a0ef05e68b8e1649f10395fe12c1db0be480eb6f7981cd",
      "text": "Oh, I don't intend to lose on that\ncount.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
